name: Read actual completed OAuth investigation at six sizes with no new requests
size: 120x36
cwd: @TARGET
env-unset: NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL
env: HOME=/private/tmp/kuzushi-live-owned-investigation-20261010/home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TARGET
submit: map
require-live-snap: 30 SYSTEM SUMMARY | real-map-summary
resize: 160x48
live-snap: summary-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: summary-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: summary-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: summary-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: summary-40x12
nav-mode:
keys: End
live-snap: compact-summary-tail
resize: 120x36
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 25 DATA-FLOW DIAGRAM | real-dfd
ask: Does the live-generated summary distinguish inspected greeting code from its unspecified caller, with source limits and readable graph navigation?
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 30 Viewing Review | actual-review-list
require-live-snap: 30 FINDINGS · 1 | settled-review-list
